<title>RUSSIA: Russia auctions 11.5 trln rbls bills, bonds Apr 30.</title>
<headline>Russia auctions 11.5 trln rbls bills, bonds Apr 30.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry will auction 7.5 trillion roubles of 322-day GKO discount Treasury bills (series 22081) and 4.0 trillion roubles of two-year OFZ government bonds (series 24012) on April 30, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    Series number		   22081</p>
<p>    Issue volume		    7.50 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denomination		    1.00 million</p>
<p>    Tenor			     322 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		   Mar 18, 1998</p>
<p>    Series number		   24012</p>
<p>    Issue volume		    4.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denomination		    1.00 million</p>
<p>    Tenor			     728 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		   Apr 28, 1999</p>
<p>    First coupon date	     Oct 29, 1997</p>
<p>    Second coupon date	    Apr 29, 1998</p>
<p>    Third coupon date	     Oct 28, 1998</p>
<p>    Fourth coupon date	    Apr 28, 1999</p>
<p>    First coupon amount	   32.52 pct</p>
<p>On April 30 the Finance Ministry will also repay 6.87 trillion roubles in a maturing issue of six-month T-bills (series 22050).</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
